{"id":"809479f98d99c157","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-first-order-language.md","title":"一阶语言的符号签名","display":"df-first-order-language — 一阶语言的符号签名","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-first-order-language","aliases":["43-df-first-order-language"],"display":"df-first-order-language — 一阶语言的符号签名","depends_on":["[[43-df-variable]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"本目录内建一阶逻辑语法/语义支撑；原书仅预设通常逻辑，未定位到独立对应条目","source_scope":"local-support","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-first-order-language"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-first-order-language</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-first-order-language — 一阶语言的符号签名"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d30a215bc9db4b5d\" href=\"?note=d30a215bc9db4b5d\" title=\"43-df-variable\">43-df-variable</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"本目录内建一阶逻辑语法/语义支撑；原书仅预设通常逻辑，未定位到独立对应条目"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"local-support"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 为集合论元语言中的候选签名；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，函数符号族与关系符号族均以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span> 为索引域。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,(F_n)_{n\\ge1},(R_n)_{n\\ge1}\">\\(C,(F_n)_{n\\ge1},(R_n)_{n\\ge1}\\)</span> 为集合与集合族；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Var}=\\{(0,n):n\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Var}=\\{(0,n):n\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d30a215bc9db4b5d\" href=\"?note=d30a215bc9db4b5d\" title=\"43-df-variable\">43-df-variable</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Lang}_1\">\\(\\operatorname{Lang}_1\\)</span> 是满足下式的签名类；非逻辑符号的第二分量允许任意集合标签。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\operatorname{Lang}_1\\iff\\exists C\\;\\exists(F_n)_{n\\ge1}\\;\\exists(R_n)_{n\\ge1}\\;\\Bigl(L=(C,(F_n)_{n\\ge1},(R_n)_{n\\ge1})\\land\\forall c\\in C\\;\\exists a\\;(c=(1,a))\\land\\forall n\\ge1\\;\\forall f\\in F_n\\;\\exists a\\;(f=(2,(n,a)))\\land\\forall n\\ge1\\;\\forall R\\in R_n\\;\\exists a\\;(R=(3,(n,a)))\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[L\\in\\operatorname{Lang}_1\\iff\\exists C\\;\\exists(F_n)_{n\\ge1}\\;\\exists(R_n)_{n\\ge1}\\;\\Bigl(L=(C,(F_n)_{n\\ge1},(R_n)_{n\\ge1})\\land\\forall c\\in C\\;\\exists a\\;(c=(1,a))\\land\\forall n\\ge1\\;\\forall f\\in F_n\\;\\exists a\\;(f=(2,(n,a)))\\land\\forall n\\ge1\\;\\forall R\\in R_n\\;\\exists a\\;(R=(3,(n,a)))\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"L_{\\rm Const}:=C,\\qquad L_{\\rm Func,n}:=F_n,\\qquad L_{\\rm Rel,n}:=R_n\\quad(L=(C,(F_n)_{n\\ge1},(R_n)_{n\\ge1}),\\ n\\ge1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[L_{\\rm Const}:=C,\\qquad L_{\\rm Func,n}:=F_n,\\qquad L_{\\rm Rel,n}:=R_n\\quad(L=(C,(F_n)_{n\\ge1},(R_n)_{n\\ge1}),\\ n\\ge1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对任意通常一阶签名可先作带标签重命名。标签及元数存储在符号中，故变量、常量、不同元数的函数和关系自动不交；后续项和公式使用4以上的标签，唯一解析不再依赖口头约定。</p>\n<p>来源定位沿用附件：本目录内建一阶逻辑语法/语义支撑；原书仅预设通常逻辑，未定位到独立对应条目。本轮核查形式化的内部一致性；未重新核对原书完整证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-variable","status":"resolved","id":"d30a215bc9db4b5d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-variable","status":"resolved","id":"d30a215bc9db4b5d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ 为集合论元语言中的候选签名；$n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，函数符号族与关系符号族均以 $\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$ 为索引域。$C,(F_n)_{n\\ge1},(R_n)_{n\\ge1}$ 为集合与集合族；$\\operatorname{Var}=\\{(0,n):n\\in\\mathbb N\\}$ 采用 [[43-df-variable]]。$\\operatorname{Lang}_1$ 是满足下式的签名类；非逻辑符号的第二分量允许任意集合标签。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"C,(F_n)_{n\\ge1},(R_n)_{n\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Var}=\\{(0,n):n\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Lang}_1","display":false},{"tex":"L\\in\\operatorname{Lang}_1\\iff\\exists C\\;\\exists(F_n)_{n\\ge1}\\;\\exists(R_n)_{n\\ge1}\\;\\Bigl(L=(C,(F_n)_{n\\ge1},(R_n)_{n\\ge1})\\land\\forall c\\in C\\;\\exists a\\;(c=(1,a))\\land\\forall n\\ge1\\;\\forall f\\in F_n\\;\\exists a\\;(f=(2,(n,a)))\\land\\forall n\\ge1\\;\\forall R\\in R_n\\;\\exists a\\;(R=(3,(n,a)))\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"L_{\\rm Const}:=C,\\qquad L_{\\rm Func,n}:=F_n,\\qquad L_{\\rm Rel,n}:=R_n\\quad(L=(C,(F_n)_{n\\ge1},(R_n)_{n\\ge1}),\\ n\\ge1).","display":true}],"bytes":1926,"backlinks":[{"id":"f36fa03fda24ed88","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L\\in\\operatorname{Lang}_1$，$t,u,t_i\\in\\operatorname{Term}_L$；$R\\in L_{\\rm Rel,n}$、$n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$\\bar t\\in\\operatorname{Term}_L^n$。项和语言签名采用 [[43-df-term]]、[[43-df-first-order-language]]。$t=u$ 作为公式参数时表示下式 $\\operatorname{Eq}(t,u)$；元语言等号仍表示集合相等。"},{"id":"16154750d33f58cc","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f5c55ddf2aa11f80","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"961683c3b48a18ae","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L\\in\\operatorname{Lang}_1$；$f\\in L_{\\rm Func,n}$、$n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$\\bar t=(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)$ 为有限元组。变量和非逻辑符号的标签采用 [[43-df-variable]]、[[43-df-first-order-language]]。$f(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)$ 是下式定义的语法对象。"},{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-489","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-first-order-language]] — 一阶语言的符号签名"}],"outgoing":["d30a215bc9db4b5d"]}